e-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.aidschicago.org/community/modules.php&#x0003f;name&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;CMNews&#x00026;secid&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;5&#x00026;sid&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;361">http://www.aidschicago.org/community/modules.php?name&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;CMNews&#x00026;secid&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;5&#x00026;sid&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;361</ext-link>. Accessed 16 August 2006</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-GlaxoSmithKline1"><label>23</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>GlaxoSmithKline News Archive</collab><year>10 August 2006</year><article-title>GSK Patents and Patent Applications for Combivir.</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.gsk.com/ControllerServlet&#x0003f;appId&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;4&#x00026;pageId&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;402&#x00026;newsid&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;874">http://www.gsk.com/ControllerServlet?appId&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;4&#x00026;pageId&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;402&#x00026;newsid&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;874</ext-link>. Accessed 22 September 2006</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-Medicins1"><label>24</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>Medicins Sans Frontieres</collab><year>December 2005</year><article-title>Amendment to WTO TRIPS Agreement Makes Access to Affordable Medicines Even More Bleak: MSF Concerned that Patients the World over Will Have to Pay the Price.</article-title><comment>MSF Press Release December 6, 2005. Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.doctorswithoutborders.org/pr/2005/12-06-2005_1.cfm">http://www.doctorswithoutborders.org/pr/2005/12-06-2005_1.cfm</ext-link>. Accessed 16 August 2006</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-Medicins2"><label>25</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>Medicins Sans Frontieres</collab><year>July 2006</year><article-title>Untangling the web of price reductions: a pricing guide for the purchase of ARVs for developing countries 9<sup>th</sup> edition.</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.accessmed-msf.org/documents/untanglingtheweb&#x00025;209.pdf">http://www.accessmed-msf.org/documents/untanglingtheweb&#x00025;209.pdf</ext-link>. Accessed 9 January 2007</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-UNAIDS1"><label>26</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>UNAIDS</collab><year>2006</year><article-title>2006 Report on the Global AIDS Epidemic.</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://data.unaids.org/pub/GlobalReport/2006/2006_GR_ANN2_en.pdf">http://data.unaids.org/pub/GlobalReport/2006/2006_GR_ANN2_en.pdf</ext-link>. Accessed 7 September 2006</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-Medical1"><label>27</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>Medical News Today</collab><year>6 December 2006</year><article-title>Thai Health Ministry To Issue Compulsory License For Merck's HIV/AIDS Drug Efavirenz.</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.medicalnewstoday.com/medicalnews.php&#x0003f;newsid&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;58037">http://www.medicalnewstoday.com/medicalnews.php?newsid&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;58037</ext-link>. Accessed 9 January 2007</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-Food1"><label>28</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>Food and Drug Administration</collab><year>2005</year><article-title>Several AIDS drugs tentatively approved. <italic>FDA Consum</italic>.</article-title><comment>2005 Sep-Oct;39(5):3 Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.fda.gov/fdac/departs/2005/505_upd.html&#x00023;aids">http://www.fda.gov/fdac/departs/2005/505_upd.html#aids</ext-link>. Accessed 16 August 2006</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-Camp1"><label>29</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>Camp, Rob</collab><year>2006</year><article-title>Antiretrovirals Pipeline Report 2006. <italic>Treatment Action Group</italic> December 8, 2006.</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.thebody.com/tag/pdfs/pipeline.pdf">http://www.thebody.com/tag/pdfs/pipeline.pdf</ext-link>. Accessed 16 February 2006</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-Kober1"><label>30</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kober</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>van Damme</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Scaling up access to antiretroviral treatment in southern Africa: who will do the job?</article-title><source>Lancet</source><volume>364</volume><fpage>103</fpage><lpage>107</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15234864</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-The1"><label>31</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>The Global Fund to Fight AIDS, Tuberculosis, and Malaria</collab><year>2006</year><article-title>Distribution of Funding after 5 Rounds 2006.</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.theglobalfund.org/en/funds_raised/distribution/">http://www.theglobalfund.org/en/funds_raised/distribution/</ext-link>. Accessed 16 August 2006</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-AVERT1"><label>32</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>AVERT</collab><year>2006</year><article-title>President's Emergency Plan For AIDS Relief.</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.avert.org/pepfar.htm">http://www.avert.org/pepfar.htm</ext-link>. Accessed 16 August 2006</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-The2"><label>33</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>The Economic Times</collab><year>5 September 2006</year><article-title>AIDS Drug Viread Prices May Dip Soon.</article-title><comment>Available:http://economictimes.indiatimes.com/articleshow/1953156.cms Accessed 9 January 2007</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000278-Westerhaus1"><label>34</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Westerhaus</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Castro</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>How do intellectual property law and international trade agreements affect access to antiretroviral therapy?</article-title><source>PLoS Med</source><volume>3(8)</volume><fpage>e332</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16881728</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><sec sec-type="display-objects"><title>Figures and Tables</title><table-wrap id="pone-0000278-t001" position="float"><object-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1371/journal.pone.0000278.t001</object-id><label>Table 1</label><caption><title>First and Second Line Antiretroviral Drugs Procured for Sub-Saharan Africa</title></caption><graphic id="pone-0000278-t001-1" xlink:href="pone.0000278.t001"/><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" alternate-form-of="pone-0000278-t001-1"><colgroup span="1"><col align="left" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/></colgroup><thead><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Drug Name</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Volume (patient year equivalents)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x00025; of Total Volume</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Percentage Brand</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Percentage Generic</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Avg. Brand Price<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="nt103">&#x0002a;</xref></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Avg. Generic Price<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="nt103">&#x0002a;</xref></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1